'''Sunset''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was obtainable by purchasing the 25th tier in the Battle Pass for 90,000 [[Beach Balls (Currency)|Beach Balls]] {{Currency|Beach Ball}} During the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
The weapon has an indigo-to-yellow colorized fade throughout the blade of the knife, resembling a sunset, hence the name. The guard of the sword appears as a sun that glows of a neon-yellow light. Multiple purple clouds are present along the blade, but most are embodied around the sun/guard.

== Trivia ==
*It pairs with the godly gun [[Sunrise]] making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Sun Set|Sun Set]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart called [[Chroma Sunset]].
*This is the third godly that could be obtained in a Battle Pass, the other two being [[Bat]] knife and [[Makeshift]] gun, both from the [[Halloween Event 2022]].
*It is the second weapon in [[Murder Mystery 2]] to have the [[FX Weapons|FX]] tag that could be claimed in a Battle Pass with the first being [[Gingerscope]].

